React + TypeScript + Vite" tooltip="Text input ya spiritual voice question → POST /api/ask. Request mein sirf question, language aur tone jata hai. Pichhli chat history AI request mein nahi bheji ja rahi; history browser localStorage mein hai.
src/components/ChatBox.tsx · askFromTranscript"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="translate" label="2 · Search query Hindi mein
Hinglish / English → Devanagari" tooltip="Agar sawaal mein Devanagari hai to query unchanged rehti hai. Warna Groq translation try hota hai; same query ki translation memory mein cache hoti hai. Original sawaal answer prompt mein rehta hai. Translation fail hone par raw question se search hota hai.
server/controllers/askController.js · toHindiSearchQuery"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="retrieval" label="3 · Neon mein relevant text search
Full-text rank → maximum 5 hits" tooltip="videos + transcript_chunks tables search hoti hain. GIN full-text index, websearch_to_tsquery aur ts_rank_cd se rank milta hai. Sirf status=done videos. Zero hits par same query ka ILIKE substring search. Current configured provider: neon. Ye lexical RAG hai; is route mein embeddings/vector similarity use nahi ho rahi.
server/services/neonRetrievalService.js · searchNeonChunks(question, 5)"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="context" label="4 · AI ko kitna DB text milta hai?
≤5 main chunks + ≤5 next chunks" tooltip="Har matching chunk ke saath usi video ka next chunk LEFT JOIN se aata hai, agar uska text 30 characters se bada ho. Isliye maximum 5 source entries, har entry mein main + next passage: up to 10 chunk texts; overlap possible hai. Full video transcript ya poora DB nahi bheja jata. Har passage ke saath title aur timestamps hain. Chunk target aam taur par ~900 characters hai; prompt ka fixed character/token cap nahi hai.
server/services/neonRetrievalService.js · next_c JOIN; askController.js · formatSources"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="prompt" label="5 · Sawaal + sources + rules
RAG context prompt taiyar" tooltip="Original question + retrieved passages + language/tone instructions combine hote hain. Model ko sirf in sources se jawab dene, har claim par [Source N] cite karne, quotations na banane aur evidence kam ho to clear bolne ki instruction hai. Ye prompt instruction hai; factual correctness ki automatic guarantee nahi.
server/controllers/askController.js · source-grounded prompt"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="model" label="6 · AI model answer likhta hai
Groq → Gemini → OpenAI fallback" tooltip="Configured enabled providers order: Groq, phir Gemini, phir OpenAI. Groq models in code: qwen/qwen3.8-27b → openai/gpt-oss-120b → openai/gpt-oss-20b. Gemini model API list se Flash choose hota hai. OpenAI fallback: gpt-4o-mini. Har provider attempt par ~12 sec application timeout. Output limit 800 tokens, temperature 0.3. Ek successful provider ka answer return hota hai; sab models ke answers combine nahi hote. Ye code configuration hai, current live model availability verify nahi ki gayi.
server/controllers/askController.js · AI_PROVIDERS / callAIWithFallback"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="citations" label="7 · Cited sources filter hote hain
0–5 displayed sources" tooltip="Backend answer mein [Source N] references parse karta hai. Sirf actually cited candidates return hote hain; numbering remap hoti hai. Example: retrieved 5, cited 2 aur 5 → UI ko 2 sources milte hain. Invalid citation numbers remove hote hain. Valid citation zero ho to unsupported-answer message aata hai. Abhi ye citation-number validation hai, har sentence ka meaning source se verify karne wala separate judge nahi.
server/services/sourceAttribution.js · selectCitedSources"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="display" label="8 · User ko answer + video proof
Short answer / Read more / clips" tooltip="Response: answer, sources, sourceCount, provider, retrievalMode aur timings. UI short answer pehle dikhati hai; &lt;&lt;&lt;more&gt;&gt;&gt; ke baad detailed answer Read more mein. Source passage aur continuation khol sakte hain. Backend videoId + real startTime se YouTube timestamp link banata hai; clip end continuation ke end tak ja sakta hai. Model YouTube links/timestamps invent nahi karta.
server/controllers/askController.js · response; src/components/ChatBox.tsx"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="edge0" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="question" target="translate" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge1" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="translate" target="retrieval" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge2" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="retrieval" target="context" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge3" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="context" target="prompt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge4" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="prompt" target="model" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge5" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="model" target="citations" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge6" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="citations" target="display" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="YouTube → Transcript → Neon"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="1200" grid="1" page="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="1400"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><object id="youtube" label="1 · Official Bhajan Marg playlists
Real title ke #number se mapping" tooltip="yt-dlp official playlists se title aur YouTube URL nikalta hai. #1–#1421 target hai. Playlist position se episode number guess nahi karte. Private/untitled entries unresolved rehti hain.
server/scripts/discoverEkantik.js; server/config/ekantik-backfill.json"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="batch" label="2 · Resume hone wale batches
#1–#50 → #51–#100 → …" tooltip="Worker Neon coverage read karke completed episodes skip karta hai. Local worker.lock duplicate process rokta hai. State mein current episode, retries aur unresolved numbers hain. One-hour retry cooldown, at most 3 attempts. Progress metadata local hai; transcript backup nahi banta.
server/scripts/seedMissingEkantik.js"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="captions" label="3 · Pehle YouTube captions
yt-dlp · Hindi first" tooltip="Existing seeder Hindi captions, phir English try karta hai. Captions se timed segments aur joined transcript bante hain. #8 mein rolling captions ki same line baar-baar join hone ka defect mila tha. Transcript text ASR ki galat spellings bhi rakh sakta hai.
server/services/autoSeeder.js · fetchYouTubeCaptionTranscript"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="assembly" label="4 · Captions na mile to audio
Audio → existing AssemblyAI" tooltip="Temporary audio yt-dlp/FFmpeg se nikalta hai. Current backfill explicitly AssemblyAI use karta hai; words ke timestamps ko roughly 45-word segments mein group karta hai. Ye transcription AI audio ko text banata hai. Q&amp;A model ka kaam alag hai. Is backfill mein OpenAI Whisper fallback select nahi hai.
server/services/autoSeeder.js · transcribeWithAssemblyAI; processVideo"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="quality" label="5 · Quality gate — automation pending
Repetition / timestamps / coverage" tooltip="User ne alag small automation ko kaam diya hai. Requested: rolling-caption duplicates timestamp ke basis par clean karna, real repeated speech preserve karna, empty/repetitive/bad timing par done block karna, tests aur #8 repair. Code review ke is snapshot mein gate implemented assume nahi kiya gaya. Current seeder mein empty transcript/chunks check hai.
Automation: ekantik-transcript-quality-layer · delegated, not verified complete"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="chunks" label="6 · Transcript ke timed chunks
~900 characters per chunk target" tooltip="Transcript timed segments ko chunks mein joda jata hai; har chunk text, startTime, endTime, index aur source rakhta hai. Existing chunker cleanText aur similar-chunk dedup bhi chalata hai. 900-character target exact hard limit nahi; bada input segment bada chunk bana sakta hai. Raw joined transcript aur search chunks alag fields hain.
server/services/retrievalService.js · buildChunksFromTranscript"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="neon" label="7 · Neon mein atomic save
videos + transcript_chunks" tooltip="videos: video ID, title, URL, full transcript, status, transcript hash. transcript_chunks: indices, text, cleaned/search text, start/end timestamps, source, hash. Video aur saare chunks ek SQL transaction mein commit hote hain; chunk count mismatch par rollback. Current snapshot: 1,071 videos aur 104,362 chunks. Koi transcript backup ya Mongo mirror nahi.
server/services/syncSeedToNeon.js; server/migrations/001_init_neon_schema.sql"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="index" label="8 · DB ka search index ready
GIN full-text index on search_text" tooltip="Normalized search_text par PostgreSQL GIN index hai. Isse sawaal ke keywords se matching passages jaldi milte hain. Ingestion se naya Q&amp;A model train/fine-tune nahi hota. Searchable text DB mein badhta hai; model ko har sawaal par selected passages context mein milte hain.
server/migrations/001_init_neon_schema.sql; neonRetrievalService.js"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="edge0" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="youtube" target="batch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge1" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="batch" target="captions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge2" value="No captions" edge="1" parent="1" source="captions" target="assembly" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge3" value="Captions found" edge="1" parent="1" source="captions" target="quality" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge4" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="assembly" target="quality" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge5" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="quality" target="chunks" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge6" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="chunks" target="neon" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge7" value="" edge="1" parent="1" source="neon" target="index" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Voice, fallbacks &amp; limits"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="1200" grid="1" page="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="1400"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><object id="mic" label="1 · Mic → browser speech recognition
SpeechRecognition / webkitSpeechRecognition" tooltip="Browser spoken input ko text banata hai. Spiritual live question normal /api/ask RAG route par jata hai. Transcription language/browser behavior par depend karti hai.
src/components/ChatBox.tsx · recognition / handleSend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="casual" label="2 · Casual live talk ka separate path
Frontend replies; DB search nahi" tooltip="Live mode mein non-spiritual question par frontend getLiveConversationReply canned/rule-based response deta hai. Is branch mein RAG ya Q&amp;A AI API call nahi hoti. Typed questions aur spiritual voice questions backend ask route use karte hain.
src/components/ChatBox.tsx · isSpiritualQuestion / getLiveConversationReply"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="40" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="tts" label="3 · Answer → awaaz
ElevenLabs route → browser fallback" tooltip="Frontend /api/tts try karta hai; backend ElevenLabs use karta hai agar key configured ho. Snapshot mein ElevenLabs key absent hai; configured hone ki guarantee nahi. Browser speechSynthesis fallback se voice output mil sakta hai. Text-to-speech answer ko padhkar sunata hai, answer research nahi karta.
server/server.js · /api/tts; src/components/ChatBox.tsx · speakText"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="mongo" label="4 · Neon miss/error → legacy Mongo
Search fallback code abhi maujood" tooltip="Neon-only NEW INGESTION ke bawajood ask route Neon zero hits/error par MongoDB read fallback karta hai. Mongo text search maximum 50 videos shortlist karta hai; no text matches par 100 done videos read karta hai. Inke chunks score karke maximum 3 main passages + next passages liye jate hain. New Neon-only episodes is legacy Mongo copy mein nahi hain.
server/controllers/askController.js · loadCandidateVideos; searchRelevantChunks(...,3)"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="vector" label="5 · Vector/Pinecone file legacy hai
Active /api/ask route use nahi karta" tooltip="vectorService.js mein OpenAI embedding + Pinecone helper code hai. Mounted /api/ask code is helper ko call/import nahi karta. Current primary retrieval PostgreSQL lexical full-text hai; diagram mein vector DB ko active component kehna galat hoga.
server/services/vectorService.js; server/controllers/askController.js imports"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="nohits" label="6 · Evidence na mile to kya hota hai?
0 DB hits → answer-generation call skip" tooltip="Neon aur Mongo dono se no matches hon to no-answer response, sources empty aur aiMs=0 return hota hai. Translation ke liye earlier AI call ho sakti hai. Matches mile par answer mein valid citations zero hon to unsupported-answer message. Valid citation ka hona factual correctness ka proof nahi hai.
server/controllers/askController.js · noAnswerText / noSupportedAnswerText"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="480" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="limits" label="7 · Abhi ki important limits
Citation check ≠ factual verification" tooltip="Koi separate semantic/fact judge nahi. Ingest quality defect answer ko affect kar sakta hai. Model poori video nahi sunta. Prompt context ka explicit budget/trim nahi. Answer generation output cap 800 tokens hai. Model ko chat history nahi milti. API totalVideos value code mein 1048 hardcoded hai; live DB ab 1071 hai, isliye UI count stale ho sakta hai.
server/controllers/askController.js · totalVideos=1048; max_tokens=800"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="500" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="rag" label="8 · RAG ka exact role
Retrieve → context → generate" tooltip="RAG ek workflow hai: DB se evidence retrieve karo, user sawaal ke saath prompt mein do, phir language model se supported answer likhwao. Retrieval decide karta hai kaunsa evidence dikhega; model us evidence ka answer banata hai. Galat/missing retrieval ko model reliably theek nahi kar sakta. Is app mein model ko directly DB credentials ya unrestricted DB access nahi diya jata.
server/controllers/askController.js · askFromIndexedTranscripts"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontSize=15;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="380" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>